| Url         | ![Url](https://github.com/Taiizor/Sucrose/raw/develop/.screenshots/Url2.gif)                 | Yes         | Fixed      | Variable    |
| Web         | ![Web](https://github.com/Taiizor/Sucrose/raw/develop/.screenshots/Web2.gif)                 | Yes         | Fixed      | Variable    |
